Validation.

A password (text) is strong when:
the length of the password is at least 8 and the password is not the password in lower case.

A name (text) is blank when:
the name trimmed is "".

For example, "Kite2026!" is strong.
For example, "kite" is not strong.
For example, "alllowercase" is not strong.
For example, "   " is blank.
For example, "Yuli" is not blank.
